// `Holds(e)`/`Present(e)`, `Enabled(e)`, and `Violated(e)` ask the three state questions of an instance; on a literal they are CHR015.
Fact actor Identified by A
Fact p Identified by P
Act a Conditioned by p(P)
Duty d Holder actor Claimant actor Violated when p(P).
+a(A). +d(A, A).
?!Holds(p(P)). ?!Enabled(a(A)). ?!Violated(d(A, A)).
+p(P).
?Present(p(P)). ?Enabled(a(A)). ?Violated(d(A, A)).
